1
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:01,920
Day two.

2
00:00:02,479 --> 00:00:04,209
The infected had reached my farm.

3
00:00:04,689 --> 00:00:07,329
And now… someone was knocking at my door.

4
00:00:08,048 --> 00:00:09,028
It was my neighbor.

5
00:00:09,587 --> 00:00:11,077
He looked completely normal.

6
00:00:11,556 --> 00:00:12,486
That's what scared me.

7
00:00:13,764 --> 00:00:16,604
Here's something terrifying about real infections.

8
00:00:17,164 --> 00:00:20,714
The incubation period is the time between exposure and symptoms.

9
00:00:21,273 --> 00:00:24,053
And some diseases can spread before symptoms even appear.

10
00:00:24,772 --> 00:00:25,632
But this outbreak?

11
00:00:26,031 --> 00:00:27,501
Nobody knew how it spread.

12
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:29,770
So I kept the door closed.

13
00:00:30,409 --> 00:00:32,389
He said his family was hiding near the barn.

14
00:00:33,028 --> 00:00:35,078
I grabbed the radio, hoping for instructions.

15
00:00:35,478 --> 00:00:36,457
Nothing but static.

16
00:00:37,816 --> 00:00:39,716
Then I noticed something strange.

17
00:00:40,195 --> 00:00:42,705
Everyone near the barn was staring at the cornfield.

18
00:00:42,945 --> 00:00:43,985
Not at my house.

19
00:00:44,384 --> 00:00:45,494
I followed their eyes.

20
00:00:45,893 --> 00:00:47,843
Something was moving between the rows.

21
00:00:48,962 --> 00:00:49,732
And suddenly…

22
00:00:50,691 --> 00:00:53,641
Every infected person in the yard started backing away.

23
00:00:54,439 --> 00:00:55,549
That was the first time…

24
00:00:56,099 --> 00:00:58,050
I saw the zombies afraid.

